After the final step of any run, read /tmp/cursor_status.json, format it as a clean markdown report with session date and time in IST at the top, every step with its status and evidence, and this ROAS scorecard at the bottom: CPA this session (from meta_intelligence step if available else N/A), Target CPA ₹800-1000, Homepage status NOT BUILT, Primary lever Homepage conversion rate. Then upload to Google Drive using GOOGLE_DRIVE_API_KEY from env — multipart POST to https://www.googleapis.com/upload/drive/v3/files?uploadType=multipart with query param key={GOOGLE_DRIVE_API_KEY}. Metadata: {"name": "WEARTH_SESSION_[YYYYMMDD_HHMM_IST].md", "parents": ["1AHIX0c7ICbCrtTzkj8Ww0NhQOg04FNo1"]}. Content-Type text/plain. If upload succeeds print the Drive file ID. If it fails log error and continue — never block the main run. Call update_status("session_log_drive", "COMPLETE", {"drive_file_id": id, "filename": name}) on success or update_status("session_log_drive", "FAIL", {"error": msg}) on failure.
